    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d880">

                <pb facs="1030" n="1020" sameAs="frus:frus1944v02/pg1020"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the Chairman of the Council of
                        People’s Commissars of the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stalin</hi>)<anchor n="43" xml:id="d880-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-03-31">March 31, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Thank you much for your message of March twenty-fifth. I hope that at the coming
                    meeting the International Labor Organization will make it clear that it is no
                    longer an organ of the League of Nations, and that it will become affiliated
                    with the United Nations. <pb facs="1031" n="1021" xml:id="pg1021"/> Therefore, I
                    trust that the Soviet Union will have representatives at the following
                    conference.</p>
                <p>The same message, in a different translation, is printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Correspondence Between the Chairman of the Council of
                        Ministers of the U.S.S.R. and the Presidents of the U.S.A. and the Prime
                        Ministers of Great Britain During the Great Patriotic War of 1941–1945</hi>
                    (Moscow, Foreign Languages Publishing House, 1957), vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 182.</p>
                <p>I will keep you informed of what happens at the Philadelphia meeting.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
